{"id":"faculty-kavita_jaiswal:e0012","type":"paragraph","page":1,"text":"Dr. Kavita Jaiswal has done Ph.D in the Department of Computer Science and Engineering at National Institute of Technology (NIT) Raipur, Chhattisgarh India in the year 2022. She has received her M.Tech degree in Computer Science and Engineering from International Institute of Infor- mation Technology (IIIT) Bhubaneswar, Odisha India in the year 2018 and, received BE degree from Government Engineering College Bilaspur, Chhattisgarh India in the year 2015. She is an IEEE student member, member of Computer Society of India (CSI) and the associate member of the Institution of Engineers India (IEI).","bbox":null,"level":null,"table":null,"reader":"markdown","confidence":null,"order":0,"attrs":{},"status":"extracted","reasons":[]}
